WEBVTT

0
00:00:00.870 --> 00:00:04.059
Let's start with the process for warm transferring the caller,

1
00:00:04.309 --> 00:00:05.469
no questions asked.

2
00:00:07.409 --> 00:00:09.159
Thank you for calling member services.

3
00:00:09.289 --> 00:00:10.409
My name is Natasha.

4
00:00:10.609 --> 00:00:11.960
May I have your first and last name,

5
00:00:12.050 --> 00:00:12.590
please?

6
00:00:13.050 --> 00:00:13.439
Hi,

7
00:00:13.649 --> 00:00:16.100
will you please transfer me to the enhanced member support unit?

8
00:00:16.790 --> 00:00:17.180
Yes,

9
00:00:17.229 --> 00:00:17.909
absolutely.

10
00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:19.709
I'd be happy to transfer you over.

11
00:00:19.989 --> 00:00:22.489
Do you mind if I place you on a brief hold for just a moment?

12
00:00:22.909 --> 00:00:23.569
No problem.

13
00:00:24.069 --> 00:00:24.530
Thank you.

14
00:00:24.670 --> 00:00:25.110
One moment,

15
00:00:25.149 --> 00:00:25.610
please.

16
00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:30.979
Navigate to the phone panel to place the caller on hold.

17
00:00:35.549 --> 00:00:37.130
Once the caller is on hold,

18
00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:39.299
select the warm transfer tab,

19
00:00:39.630 --> 00:00:42.110
then search EMSU in the search bar.

20
00:00:42.430 --> 00:00:44.729
Select the correct transfer number from the list

21
00:00:44.909 --> 00:00:46.330
and press the green call button.

22
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:52.380
Wait for the EMSU agent to answer.

23
00:00:57.700 --> 00:00:58.720
Thank you for calling

24
00:01:00.479 --> 00:01:02.259
Enhanced member support unit.

25
00:01:02.799 --> 00:01:03.259
Hi there,

26
00:01:03.319 --> 00:01:06.290
I have a caller that requested to be transferred to EMSU.

27
00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:10.260
Do you have their name or any additional information about the caller?

28
00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:11.660
I do not.

29
00:01:12.080 --> 00:01:12.440
OK,

30
00:01:12.559 --> 00:01:14.440
go ahead and complete the transfer now.

31
00:01:14.760 --> 00:01:15.040
OK,

32
00:01:15.120 --> 00:01:15.559
thank you.

33
00:01:17.389 --> 00:01:21.089
Click the transfer button in the phone panel to complete the warm transfer.